 about life as a tween girl for example  she said she got the style of braces  that she did so she would fit in with  her friends Sophia Grace is definitely  living her best life she's traveling all  over and meeting lots of cool people  we're so happy to see these two girls  having such an amazing life and internet  career we don't know what to expect from  Sophia Grace and Rosie next it's been  several months since Rosie released her  song handstand it's doing great on  YouTube and we can't wait to see what  else she does hopefully she releases  some new songs soon in the meantime  we'll keep enjoying all her videos we  loved the tour of her house she did a  few months ago and her 12 days of  Christmas videos were so fun she's great  at creating authentic fun content we  love Rosie it's pretty cool how outgoing  she is now Sophia Grace just released  can't sleep the first week of 2019 it's  already got a ton of views on YouTube  it's also available on iTunes  she'll be writing the success of this  song for a while but now that she has  established herself as a rapper and not  a pop singer we're excited to hear more  rap she's talented at both singing and  rapping maybe she'll continue to merge  the two just like her old hero Nicki  Minaj what do you think of the new songs  by Sophia Grace and Rosie let us know in  the comments section below and that's  all you need to know about Sophia Grace  Brownlee and Rosie McClelland all grown  up be sure to LIKE this video and hit  that subscribe button for more awesome  content see you next time  [Music]

